{"4592450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dolf", "steam_appid": 4592450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long after humanity fumbled the Earth, super-intelligent dolphins repurpose ocean trash to play a high-intensity underwater ball game. Race thru dense courses and launch your team's ball past obstacles to reach the big goal first. Dive in with up to 8 friends  and play a quick circuit, or a full 18 holes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/extras/839020f8fe9749e53e91510c7696a187.poster.avif?t=1784853201\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/extras/839020f8fe9749e53e91510c7696a187.webm?t=1784853201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/extras/839020f8fe9749e53e91510c7696a187.mp4?t=1784853201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer for up to 8 friends. PvP or Team-based matches. Also single-player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6DoF underwater physics movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple dolphin species with customizable attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine upgrade cards to enhance your swimmer and enable special shots, torpedos, and explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat, and a dedicated screech button.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long after humanity fumbled the Earth, super-intelligent dolphins repurpose ocean trash to play a high-intensity underwater ball game. Race thru dense courses and launch your team's ball past obstacles to reach the big goal first. Dive in with up to 8 friends  and play a quick circuit, or a full 18 holes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/extras/839020f8fe9749e53e91510c7696a187.poster.avif?t=1784853201\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/extras/839020f8fe9749e53e91510c7696a187.webm?t=1784853201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/extras/839020f8fe9749e53e91510c7696a187.mp4?t=1784853201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer for up to 8 friends. PvP or Team-based matches. Also single-player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6DoF underwater physics movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple dolphin species with customizable attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine upgrade cards to enhance your swimmer and enable special shots, torpedos, and explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat, and a dedicated screech button.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Underwater mini-golf with cybernetic dolphins. Online multiplayer for 1-8 players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/ab5fb8c4c82435c32d0b14fb33fc8d7341289609/header.jpg?t=1784853201", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592450/aa62984f11cc561841309b6d4d940a90796b2e08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784853201", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstat